{"articleNo":"367701","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=367701&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2022 파란사다리사업 참가신청자 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.05.16","hit":"6767","attachments":[{"name":"2022 파란사다리사업 국외(파견) 연수 실시 공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=367701&attachNo=112383"},{"name":"2022 파란사다리사업 참가신청서 및 서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=367701&attachNo=112384"},{"name":"2022 파란사다리사업 참가자 모집(개요).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=367701&attachNo=112385"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">교육부와 한국장학재단에서 시행하는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">년 파란사다리사업에 대구대학교가 참여대학으로 선정됨에 따라 권역 내 대학의 파란사다리 해외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">파견</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">연수 사업 참가자를 다음과 같이 모집하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, 관심있는 학생께서는 첨부하는 제출 서류 일체를 작성하시어 <b><u><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">5월 19일(목) 17:00시까지 국제교류교육원 행정실(국제교육관 103호, 박유진 주무관)로 신청</span></u></b>해 주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">사업 개요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">사업명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">2022 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">파란사다리사업 해외연수</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">     </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">사업 내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">대학의 경제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">사회적 취약계층 재학생들에게 글로벌 진로탐색 경험 제공을 통한 진로역량 개발 및 외국어능력 배양의 기회 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">학생 선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">총 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">80</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">대구대학교 재학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">58</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">타교 재학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">교육 내용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">집중 사전교육 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: 2022. 6. 27.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) ~ 7. 1.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) / 1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">주</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">해외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">파견</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">연수 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">: 2022. 7. 11.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">) ~ 8. 5.(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">) / 4</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">주</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">해외연수 국가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">호주</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(Deakin University, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">멜버른 소재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">필리핀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(Colegio San Agustin Bacolod, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">바콜로드 소재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">참가신청자 추천</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">참가자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">대한민국 국적을 소지하고 국내 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">대상교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">에 재학 중인 경제적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">사회적 취약계층 학생으로 온라인 연수 참가를 통한 자기개발 등의 의지가 있는 학부생 중 아래 해당자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">경제적 취약계층</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">한국장학재단 학자금지원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">구간 이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">기초생활수급자 및 차상위계층 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">사회적 취약계층</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">장애학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">한부모 가족 지원대상자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">탈북학생 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">추천방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">해당교에서 자체 공지하여 참가신청자를 모집한 후 제출서류를 첨부하여 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">전자공문</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">으로 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">추천</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">제출서류</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\">붙임 자료 참조</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">선발인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">대학별 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">명까지 선발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">다만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">선발인원이 부족할 경우 대학별 선발인원 추가 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">프로그램 세부내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-weight:bold;\">붙임 자료 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">붙임  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1. 2022 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">파란사다리사업 해외연수 모집 개요</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">안내문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) 1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2. 2022 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">파란사다리사업 해외연수 공고문 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">       </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3. 2022 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">파란사다리사업 참가신청서 및 서식 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림;font-family:굴림;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"17064\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 1,\n\"dv\": 0,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.1\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"11, 0, 0, 5178\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_8\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"k